{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017NigjCT82TWnN12NxZXdp8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Insights from Negative Results NLP workshop 2025 2024 review criteria scoring rubric CFP\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CFP | Insights 2024\",\"url\":\"https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/cfp/\"},{\"title\":\"Insights 2024 | Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP\",\"url\":\"https://insights-workshop.github.io/\"},{\"title\":\"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP | ACL Member Portal\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/workshop-insights-negative-results-nlp-0\"},{\"title\":\"INSIGHTS FROM NEGATIVE RESULTS IN NLP. WORKSHOP. 5TH 2025. (INSIGHTS 2025) - proceedings.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.proceedings.com/80148.html\"},{\"title\":\"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP - ACL Anthology\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/venues/insights/\"},{\"title\":\"Accepted papers | Insights 2024\",\"url\":\"https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/accepted/\"},{\"title\":\"Insights 2024 : Fifth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP\",\"url\":\"http://wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=178569\"},{\"title\":\"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP (2024) - ACL Anthology\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/events/insights-2024/\"},{\"title\":\"Proceedings of the Fourth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP - ACL Anthology\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/volumes/2023.insights-1/\"},{\"title\":\"Deadline Extension: Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP – Submit by February 10! - Corpora - ELRA lists\",\"url\":\"https://list.elra.info/mailman3/hyperkitty/list/corpora@list.elra.info/thread/CYVBNAN3VSANR773KFZQOZDGNCNVSSAO/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP. Here's what I found:\n\n## Workshop Overview\n\nThe Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP will be held in Albuquerque, New Mexico in May 2025, co-located with NAACL. The workshop will take place during NAACL 2025 (May 3-4 2025) and will be hybrid, allowing for both in-person and virtual presentations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nPublication of negative results is difficult in most fields, but in NLP the problem is exacerbated by the near-universal focus on improvements in benchmarks. This situation implicitly discourages hypothesis-driven research, and it turns creation and fine-tuning of NLP models into art rather than science.\n\n## Submission Information\n\nThe workshop will accept short papers (up to 4 pages, excluding references, appendices, limitations and broader impacts sections), as well as 1-2 page non-archival abstract submissions for papers published elsewhere. The submission deadline for the Insights 2025 Workshop has been extended to February 10, 2025 (AoE).\n\n## Note on Review Criteria and Scoring Rubric\n\nUnfortunately, the search results did not contain specific information about review criteria or a detailed scoring rubric for the workshop's CFP. The search results focused on the workshop's purpose, submission formats, and deadlines rather than the evaluation criteria. For detailed review criteria and scoring guidelines, you may want to check the full CFP page directly at https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/cfp/.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73f9f140-4f70-4f54-821d-08400ec577d5","uuid":"c1dd13ec-8158-4fb6-91c9-8fcbee50300d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:46:03.202Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Insights from Negative Results NLP workshop 2025 2024 review criteria scoring rubric CFP","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Wg8NNgFGBmoRRYzhbqtjTo","content":[{"title":"CFP | Insights 2024","url":"https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/cfp/"},{"title":"Insights 2024 | Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP","url":"https://insights-workshop.github.io/"},{"title":"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP | ACL Member Portal","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/workshop-insights-negative-results-nlp-0"},{"title":"INSIGHTS FROM NEGATIVE RESULTS IN NLP. WORKSHOP. 5TH 2025. (INSIGHTS 2025) - proceedings.com","url":"https://www.proceedings.com/80148.html"},{"title":"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP - ACL Anthology","url":"https://aclanthology.org/venues/insights/"},{"title":"Accepted papers | Insights 2024","url":"https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/accepted/"},{"title":"Insights 2024 : Fifth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP","url":"http://wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=178569"},{"title":"Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP (2024) - ACL Anthology","url":"https://aclanthology.org/events/insights-2024/"},{"title":"Proceedings of the Fourth Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP - ACL Anthology","url":"https://aclanthology.org/volumes/2023.insights-1/"},{"title":"Deadline Extension: Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP – Submit by February 10! - Corpora - ELRA lists","url":"https://list.elra.info/mailman3/hyperkitty/list/corpora@list.elra.info/thread/CYVBNAN3VSANR773KFZQOZDGNCNVSSAO/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found information about the Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP. Here's what I found:\n\n## Workshop Overview\n\nThe Workshop on Insights from Negative Results in NLP will be held in Albuquerque, New Mexico in May 2025, co-located with NAACL. The workshop will take place during NAACL 2025 (May 3-4 2025) and will be hybrid, allowing for both in-person and virtual presentations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nPublication of negative results is difficult in most fields, but in NLP the problem is exacerbated by the near-universal focus on improvements in benchmarks. This situation implicitly discourages hypothesis-driven research, and it turns creation and fine-tuning of NLP models into art rather than science.\n\n## Submission Information\n\nThe workshop will accept short papers (up to 4 pages, excluding references, appendices, limitations and broader impacts sections), as well as 1-2 page non-archival abstract submissions for papers published elsewhere. The submission deadline for the Insights 2025 Workshop has been extended to February 10, 2025 (AoE).\n\n## Note on Review Criteria and Scoring Rubric\n\nUnfortunately, the search results did not contain specific information about review criteria or a detailed scoring rubric for the workshop's CFP. The search results focused on the workshop's purpose, submission formats, and deadlines rather than the evaluation criteria. For detailed review criteria and scoring guidelines, you may want to check the full CFP page directly at https://insights-workshop.github.io/2025/cfp/."],"durationSeconds":5.671753036999998}}
