{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0194mmFY7BTPPu2u3dCx98ZE","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ACL Rolling Review reviewer form 2025 2026 scoring scale overall assessment soundness\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CALL FOR PAPERS – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Reviewer Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Dashboard\",\"url\":\"https://stats.aclrollingreview.org/\"},{\"title\":\"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing\"},{\"title\":\"Incentives 2026 – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2026\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review Data Collection (ARR-DC) - ARR Data Collection\",\"url\":\"https://arr-data.aclweb.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ACL ARR | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR\"},{\"title\":\"ACL ARR 2025 May | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FMay\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the ACL Rolling Review scoring system:\n\nStarting with February 2025, ARR reviewers are asked to provide three scores: soundness, excitement, and overall recommendation. Additionally, the soundne